{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../", "title": "docworm"}, "next": {"link": "../models/", "title": "Data Models"}, "title": "DocWorm Client", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"docworm-client\">\n<h1>DocWorm Client<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm-client\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm\">\n<span class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></span><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">docworm.client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DocWorm</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">base_url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">api_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>SDK client for the DocWorm service.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>base_url</strong> -- DocWorm service URL (default: DOCWORM_URL env &gt; config.yaml &gt; hosted).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>api_key</strong> -- DocWorm API key, dw_live_... (default: DOCWORM_API_KEY env &gt; config.yaml).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Usage:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"n\">client</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">DocWorm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"...\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">upload</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"report.pdf\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">status</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wait_for_indexing</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.upload\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">upload</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">BinaryIO</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">filename</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">project_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">chat_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">folder_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.UploadResponse\" title=\"docworm.models.UploadResponse\"><span class=\"pre\">UploadResponse</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.upload\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Upload a document for indexing.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>file</strong> -- File path (str), raw bytes, or file-like object.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>filename</strong> -- Original filename (auto-detected from path if str).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>file_id</strong> -- Optional custom file ID (server generates one otherwise).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>project_id</strong> -- Optional scoping context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>chat_id</strong> -- Optional scoping context.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>folder_id</strong> -- Optional scoping context.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>UploadResponse with file_id for subsequent indexing.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.index\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">index</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">project_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">chat_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">folder_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">BinaryIO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">filename</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.IndexResponse\" title=\"docworm.models.IndexResponse\"><span class=\"pre\">IndexResponse</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.index\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Index an already-uploaded document (or upload + index in one step\nby passing <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">file</span></code>).</p>\n<p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></code> is sent as a query parameter; the optional scoping\nfields are still form fields.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>IndexResponse \u2014 usually <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">status=&quot;queued&quot;</span></code>; poll with\nwait_for_indexing() until ready.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.upload_and_index\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">upload_and_index</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">BinaryIO</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">filename</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">project_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">chat_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">folder_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.IndexResponse\" title=\"docworm.models.IndexResponse\"><span class=\"pre\">IndexResponse</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.upload_and_index\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Upload and immediately index a document (convenience method).</p>\n<p>Returns the queued IndexResponse \u2014 call wait_for_indexing() to\nblock until the document is ready.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.index_json\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">index_json</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">tree</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">filename</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'document.json'</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.IndexResponse\" title=\"docworm.models.IndexResponse\"><span class=\"pre\">IndexResponse</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.index_json\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Index a pre-built tree JSON directly (programmatic ingestion).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>IndexResponse with status=&quot;completed&quot;.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.index_batch\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">index_batch</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_ids</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.index_batch\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Batch reindex up to 100 files (concurrency-gated by plan).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dict with queued count, concurrency, and per-file results.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.retry_failed_pages\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">retry_failed_pages</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.retry_failed_pages\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Re-queue only the failed pages of a partial document.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dict with retried_pages, enqueued count, and total_pages.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.cancel_indexing\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cancel_indexing</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_ids</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.cancel_indexing\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Cancel in-flight indexing tasks for documents.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dict with cancelled task count.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.reset_index\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reset_index</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.reset_index\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Wipe derived state for a doc without uploading new bytes\n(used by the replace flow).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dict with reset bool.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.list_documents\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list_documents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.list_documents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>List all documents for the authenticated user.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.get_document_status\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_document_status</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.DocumentStatus\" title=\"docworm.models.DocumentStatus\"><span class=\"pre\">DocumentStatus</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_document_status\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the indexing status and progress of a document.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.wait_for_indexing\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">wait_for_indexing</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">600</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">poll_interval</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">5</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.DocumentStatus\" title=\"docworm.models.DocumentStatus\"><span class=\"pre\">DocumentStatus</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.wait_for_indexing\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Poll until document indexing completes or times out.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>RuntimeError</strong> -- If indexing fails or is cancelled.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>TimeoutError</strong> -- If indexing doesn't complete in time.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.get_document_pages\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_document_pages</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.PageInfo\" title=\"docworm.models.PageInfo\"><span class=\"pre\">PageInfo</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_document_pages\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>List all pages of a document with their extraction status.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.get_page_content\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_page_content</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">page_num</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../models/#docworm.models.PageContent\" title=\"docworm.models.PageContent\"><span class=\"pre\">PageContent</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_page_content\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the extracted markdown content for a single page.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.get_page_image\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_page_image</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">page_num</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span c