return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_node_map\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the flat node-id \u2192 node map for a document.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.get_excel_preview\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_excel_preview</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_excel_preview\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Preview every sheet of an Excel file (headers + first rows).</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dict with fileId, filename, and sheets list.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"docworm.client.DocWorm.delete_document\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete_document</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">file_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></span></span><a clas